sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as Wallet
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant SC as Smart Contracts
  participant SG as Subgraph

  Note over U,SC: Mint Flow
  U->>FE: Open /mint
  FE->>W: Request signature / approve collateral
  W-->>FE: Signature
  FE->>SC: depositCollateral + mintUSDx
  SC-->>FE: Transaction receipt
  FE->>SG: Query position
  SG-->>FE: Updated LTV/Health

  Note over U,SC: Swap Flow
  U->>FE: Open /swap
  FE->>SC: swapExact via StableSwap/PSM
  SC-->>FE: Transaction receipt

  Note over U,SC: Auction Flow
  U->>FE: Open /auctions
  FE->>SC: bid on lot
  SC-->>FE: Bid accepted